{"steam_appid":4992990,"steam_name":"Horny Asylum","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4992990/1781706682/d638061dcbf2184753ebbeb8c590328e19014f14/1785159084/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785844991","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257385942/531fccd298d5cef722ba2b61fcfd91dc3fb7618e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785844991","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/3eeb472cf1b173515630a9d7553dbccb6f990996/ss_3eeb472cf1b173515630a9d7553dbccb6f990996.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786642093","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/3a870d7a432714c7f81ac4fef40704a5dd0e885b/ss_3a870d7a432714c7f81ac4fef40704a5dd0e885b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786642093","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/3bbd0846d84de58ffb5b71df3d1267ed4ec6bf23/ss_3bbd0846d84de58ffb5b71df3d1267ed4ec6bf23.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786642093","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/a5065ab08b9803536d4fcc180b77067b792eb32b/ss_a5065ab08b9803536d4fcc180b77067b792eb32b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786642093","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/e30fd73a1c0c7a22473219160a7986765e083d48/ss_e30fd73a1c0c7a22473219160a7986765e083d48.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786642093"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO THE NIGHT SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve just taken the job as the sole night guard at the wildest facility in town: the <strong>Horny Asylum</strong>. Your mission is simple: watch the security feeds, keep order, and survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s just one problem. The inmates are overwhelmingly  lusty, and you are their target!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR CABIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes glued to the security monitors and track the girls as they prowl through the dark hallways and ventilation shafts. If they get too close to your office, slam the blast doors shut to keep them at bay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/192b25b894e38c13ea62628bb1efdd21.poster.avif?t=1786642093\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/192b25b894e38c13ea62628bb1efdd21.webm?t=1786642093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/192b25b894e38c13ea62628bb1efdd21.mp4?t=1786642093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind your battery supply!</strong> Every door closure drains your limited power bar. If your battery hits 0%, the power cuts out, the doors unlock, and the girls will finally get their hands on you... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/00938d1144a0844d97f83847f0c26852.poster.avif?t=1786642093\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/00938d1144a0844d97f83847f0c26852.webm?t=1786642093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/00938d1144a0844d97f83847f0c26852.mp4?t=1786642093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Challenging Asylum Wings:</strong> Test your reflexes and tactical power management across 6 distinct sectors, each bringing tougher challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Unique Inmates:</strong> Face off against 8 uniquely different girls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of  Costumes:</strong> Each inmates have their wardrobes of spicy outfits to tempt you throughout the shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of High-Quality Renders:</strong> Unlock an extensive gallery filled with hundreds of detailed renders.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/e4f5b4167201cd59971cc95bdcc5af84.poster.avif?t=1786642093\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/e4f5b4167201cd59971cc95bdcc5af84.webm?t=1786642093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/e4f5b4167201cd59971cc95bdcc5af84.mp4?t=1786642093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you keep your cool under pressure and clear every wing, or will you surrender to their desires? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/01d5406d3cc6aa6e969344b63fea6036.poster.avif?t=1786642093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/01d5406d3cc6aa6e969344b63fea6036.webm?t=1786642093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992990/extras/01d5406d3cc6aa6e969344b63fea6036.mp4?t=1786642093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The asylum awaits</strong></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10  (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> H.264 (Intel HD 4000 / equivalent+)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 / RX 560 / Intel UHD 620+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","genres":["Simulation"],"developers":["FleshForge Studio"],"publishers":["FleshForge Studio"],"release_date":"Aug 31, 2026"}